  "segments": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "1.前往维诺亚村，白天或黄昏或清晨，与一郎（47.52）对话，选“是”获得【鬼的标志】。",
      "type": "time-step-acquisition",
      "sourceLines": [
        1
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": "◆【鬼的标志】：Lv.1手环、耐久100~120；装备后获得称号“捉迷藏的铁人”；不可交易",
      "type": "equipment-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        2
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "2.装备【鬼的标志】，白天或黄昏或清晨，寻找维诺亚村内藏于各处的三位小孩并与之对话，获得相应【道具】。",
      "type": "equipment-gated-collection",
      "sourceLines": [
        3
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "◆小孩位置（小孩会在坐标点约九宫格大小范围内小幅度移动）：",
      "type": "location-note",
      "sourceLines": [
        4
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "名称坐标道具",
      "type": "table-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        5
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "忽达巴（61~66.50）鸟的羽毛",
      "type": "collection-row",
      "sourceLines": [
        6
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "小白（41~46.29~34）黑色的碎石头",
      "type": "collection-row",
      "sourceLines": [
        7
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "阿三（31~37.65~67）壁虎干",
      "type": "collection-row",
      "sourceLines": [
        8
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "3.集齐3个【道具】与一郎对话，选“是”获得【笔记】。",
      "type": "held-items-acquisition",
      "sourceLines": [
        9
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "◆每名队员都需获得【笔记】",
      "type": "party-item-gate",
      "sourceLines": [
        10
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "4.夜晚持有【笔记】调查（25.46）处玄关，选“是”进入怪医生的家。",
      "type": "night-item-gate",
      "sourceLines": [
        11
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "text": "5.通过（8.13）处楼梯下楼抵达奇怪的地下室。通过（10.6）处楼梯下楼抵达黑暗医生的洞窟。",
      "type": "route-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        12
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "text": "◆黑暗医生的洞窟为随机迷宫，随机7~8层",
      "type": "maze-note",
      "sourceLines": [
        13
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "text": "迷宫刷新时间：4小时（仅供参考），地图大小范围：50*50~100*100",
      "type": "maze-note",
      "sourceLines": [
        14
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "text": "宝箱数量：0",
      "type": "maze-note",
      "sourceLines": [
        15
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "text": "魔物为Lv.18~20腐尸、僵尸、大蝙蝠，最高遇敌数量8只",
      "type": "maze-encounter",
      "sourceLines": [
        16
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "text": "◆击倒迷宫内随机出现的多个试做型腐尸可随机获得【小根的剑】、【小根的帽子】、【小根的上衣】、【小根的帆布鞋】",
      "type": "grouped-random-drop",
      "sourceLines": [
        17
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "text": "6.通过随机迷宫抵达黑暗医生的研究所，与试作型牛鬼（23.31）对话，交出【笔记】进入战斗。",
      "type": "party-item-battle-entry",
      "sourceLines": [
        18
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 19,
      "text": "◆队伍中所有成员皆持有【笔记】才能进入战斗",
      "type": "party-item-gate",
      "sourceLines": [
        19
      ],
      "verification": {
