      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 27,
      "text": "9.白天或黄昏或清晨，与一郎（47.52）对话，选“是”，",
      "type": "time-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        27
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 28,
      "text": "交出【黑色的碎石头】、【鸟的羽毛】、【壁虎干】、【鬼的标志】、【黑暗医学指南书】获得【没有用的东西？】，任务完结。",
